  "gaps": [
    "Six of nine family records still lack photographs; reviewed Commons photographs for Dynamic, Dyna Junior and PL17 are reproducible via night-panhard-photo-apply.mjs.",
    "Pre-1930 range incomplete: Type A/B, M2F, X1/X8/X14/X19/X21/X26/X36/X45/X46/X57/X59 and other chassis need separate original-document research.",
    "6DS and 8DS omitted pending clear per-line production bounds/body mapping; 6CS partial and not an exhaustive Panoramique chassis catalogue.",
    "Selected technical rows largely provide displacement and identity; kW, torque, mass, acceleration, cycle consumption and most dimensions remain unknown. No historic HP conversion.",
    "Dynamic postwar completions until 1948 need explicit production-period modelling; 1940 denotes main series only.",
    "Dyna X passenger/utility end dates need body separation. Junior series starts 1952, distinct from 1951 premiere.",
    "CD road-series start unresolved; 1962 family start includes racing/exhibition history.",
    "24 B/BT/CT engine changes and exact intervals incomplete; no fabricated metrics from questionable museum entries."
  ],
  "excluded": [
    "Dynavia: experimental show car, not a serial road-production line.",
    "Military vehicles, trucks and later armoured products excluded.",
    "DB/Veritas/Sera/Rosengart derivatives remain separate marque-identity work."
  ],
  "sourceNotes": [
    "Museum object records used only within explicit object/model-year scopes.",
